Package: com.samcejko.backcap
Name: Backcap
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Automatically closes old background apps when you open more than N apps (0-6) and closes unused background apps when you lock the device, while keeping music and active apps running.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
